ted theatre within the University Center.","evidence_claim":"Seton Hall’s official campus map lists the University Center Theatre as a destination in the Bishop Dougherty University Center.","source_url":"https://www.shu.edu/documents/Campus_Map.pdf","source_title":"Seton Hall University Campus Map","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Event access, tickets, and seating are determined by individual programs.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
